<title>USA: Lee Enterprises Inc Q2 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>Lee Enterprises Inc Q2 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DAVENPORT, Iowa 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		  $ 0.24		    $0.19</p>
<p> Oper net		  11,240		    9,084</p>
<p> Revs		     101,787		   99,960</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  47,407		   47,780</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Period ended March 31.</p>
<p>Q2 results exclude gains from discontinued operations of $1 million or $0.02/shr vs $1.7 million or $0.04/shr.</p>
<p>6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.64		    $0.49</p>
<p> Oper net		  30,348		   23,776</p>
<p> Revs		     221,455		  210,741</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  47,617		   48,063</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Six-month results exclude gains from discontinued operations of $1 million or $0.02/shr vs $2,969,000 or $0.07/shr.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
